  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello, how are things going?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.42,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hanging in there.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.54,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Weird question. I saw my dad cry at a film yesterday for the first time ever.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's not weird, that's a big moment. What was the film?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.88,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "One about a father and son fixing up an old boat.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 3.3,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Ah, that makes sense. Films like that sometimes hit things people don't say out loud.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 1.3,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I mention it? He",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.2,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "movies.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "kind of pretended he had something in his eye.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 1.59,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "You don't have to make it a big talk. Maybe just say you liked the film too, and that it made you think of him. Let him take it from there.",
   "est_sec": 9.71,
   "gap_before": 1.02,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Yeah. That feels right.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.47,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It might mean more to him than you think.",
